{"id":"4.3","title":"Skal vi møtes en dag?","audio":"audio/4.3.mp3","duration":127.92,"synthetic":false,"sentences":[{"id":0,"start":0.15,"end":3.97,"text":"4.3 Skal vi møtes en dag?","heading":true,"zh":"4.3 我们哪天见个面好吗？","words":[[0,3,0.15,1.2,"4.3"],[4,8,2.12,2.58,"skal~d1b9dc119407"],[9,11,2.58,2.8,"vi"],[12,17,2.8,3.3,"møtes"],[18,20,3.3,3.48,"en~a939a9e56dc5"],[21,24,3.48,3.89,"dag~4cbe30580433"]]},{"id":1,"start":5.41,"end":10.1,"text":"Hei, Håvard! Lenge siden sist! Hvordan går det?","speaker":"Bjørnar","zh":"嗨，霍瓦尔！好久不见！最近怎么样？","words":[[0,3,5.46,5.8,"hei"],[5,11,5.8,6.42,"håvard"],[13,18,7.2,7.54,"lenge"],[19,24,7.54,7.82,"siden~9a3d2d89a980"],[25,29,7.82,8.44,"sist"],[31,38,9.18,9.56,"hvordan"],[39,42,9.56,9.72,"går~2536fac625ab"],[43,46,9.72,9.95,"det~8d16156bd355"]]},{"id":2,"start":10.78,"end":14.03,"text":"Takk, det går bra! Og med deg?","speaker":"Håvard","zh":"谢谢，挺好的！你呢？","words":[[0,4,10.84,11.38,"takk"],[6,9,11.66,11.82,"det~8d16156bd355"],[10,13,11.82,11.98,"går~bdf67dea99b2"],[14,17,11.98,12.36,"bra~9ed229260de6"],[19,21,13.22,13.38,"og"],[22,25,13.38,13.54,"med~0a5bad95cb9d"],[26,29,13.54,13.88,"deg"]]},{"id":3,"start":14.4,"end":21.27,"text":"Fint, men jeg har mye å gjøre. Jeg jobber mye, og jeg har barna annenhver uke.","speaker":"Bjørnar","zh":"挺好，不过我有很多事要做。我工作很忙，而且每隔一周要带孩子。","words":[[0,4,14.46,15.12,"fint"],[6,9,15.64,15.8,"men"],[10,13,15.8,15.96,"jeg"],[14,17,15.96,16.26,"har"],[18,21,16.26,16.6,"mye~cc164d0dc3da"],[22,23,16.6,16.7,"å~0583da7a620a"],[24,29,16.7,17.17,"gjøre"],[31,34,17.86,18.06,"jeg"],[35,41,18.06,18.48,"jobber~003ddb6d77e6"],[42,45,18.48,18.93,"mye~933c5a923198"],[47,49,19.1,19.2,"og"],[50,53,19.2,19.34,"jeg"],[54,57,19.34,19.62,"har"],[58,63,19.62,20.2,"barna"],[64,73,20.2,20.74,"annenhver"],[74,77,20.74,21.12,"uke"]]},{"id":4,"start":22.0,"end":24.08,"text":"Å, er du skilt?","speaker":"Håvard","zh":"哦，你离婚了？","words":[[0,1,22.05,22.36,"å~496a48c13525"],[3,5,23.02,23.14,"er"],[6,8,23.14,23.36,"du"],[9,14,23.36,23.93,"skilt~39bb7cd38da8"]]},{"id":5,"start":24.37,"end":25.88,"text":"Ja, det er jeg.","speaker":"Bjørnar","zh":"是的，离了。","words":[[0,2,24.43,24.77,"ja"],[4,7,25.24,25.4,"det~78c46db3f5d1"],[8,10,25.4,25.52,"er"],[11,14,25.52,25.73,"jeg"]]},{"id":6,"start":26.36,"end":29.39,"text":"Hvordan går det? Er det travelt?","speaker":"Håvard","zh":"过得怎么样？很忙吗？","words":[[0,7,26.41,26.96,"hvordan"],[8,11,26.96,27.26,"går~2536fac625ab"],[12,15,27.26,27.61,"det~8d16156bd355"],[17,19,28.24,28.38,"er"],[20,23,28.38,28.56,"det"],[24,31,28.56,29.25,"travelt"]]},{"id":7,"start":29.96,"end":46.96,"text":"Ja. Jeg begynner på jobb klokka åtte og leverer barna i barnehagen og på skolen før jobb. Det er travelt, men det går bra. Jeg pleier å stå opp tidlig om morgenen, for jeg liker å ha god tid. Hva gjør du?","speaker":"Bjørnar","zh":"是的。我八点开始上班，上班前要把孩子们送到幼儿园和学校。很忙，但还应付得来。我通常早上很早起床，因为我喜欢时间充裕一些。你是做什么的？","words":[[0,2,30.02,30.38,"ja"],[4,7,31.1,31.28,"jeg"],[8,16,31.28,31.72,"begynner"],[17,19,31.72,31.94,"på~362b62e4a2d8"],[20,24,31.94,32.22,"jobb"],[25,31,32.22,32.54,"klokka"],[32,36,32.54,33.05,"åtte"],[37,39,33.44,33.56,"og"],[40,47,33.56,34.06,"leverer"],[48,53,34.06,34.44,"barna"],[54,55,34.44,34.56,"i"],[56,66,34.56,35.32,"barnehagen"],[67,69,35.32,35.44,"og"],[70,72,35.44,35.58,"på"],[73,79,35.58,36.18,"skolen"],[80,83,36.18,36.5,"før~f9c047e06941"],[84,88,36.5,36.94,"jobb"],[90,93,37.78,37.92,"det"],[94,96,37.92,38.08,"er"],[97,104,38.08,38.8,"travelt"],[106,109,38.8,39.23,"men"],[110,113,39.36,39.52,"det"],[114,117,39.52,39.8,"går~bdf67dea99b2"],[118,121,39.8,40.17,"bra~9ed229260de6"],[123,126,41.02,41.26,"jeg"],[127,133,41.26,41.68,"pleier"],[134,135,41.68,41.78,"å~0583da7a620a"],[136,139,41.78,41.96,"stå~3e6cceed2953"],[140,143,41.96,42.14,"opp~4bb5dba4f351"],[144,150,42.14,42.5,"tidlig"],[151,153,42.5,42.6,"om~5b93c55d689f"],[154,162,42.6,43.16,"morgenen"],[164,167,43.5,43.68,"for~a05c87659379"],[168,171,43.68,43.88,"jeg"],[172,177,43.88,44.32,"liker"],[178,179,44.32,44.4,"å~0583da7a620a"],[180,182,44.4,44.56,"ha~ca5edb8b1cdb"],[183,186,44.56,44.8,"god~3bf5a9c975f3"],[187,190,44.8,45.27,"tid"],[192,195,46.3,46.46,"hva"],[196,200,46.46,46.62,"gjør"],[201,203,46.62,46.81,"du"]]},{"id":8,"start":47.55,"end":56.7,"text":"Jeg er lærer og underviser på norskkurs, og Marit er lærer på en barneskole. Vi bor sammen.","speaker":"Håvard","zh":"我是老师，在挪威语课上教课，玛丽特是一所小学的老师。我们住在一起。","words":[[0,3,47.61,47.92,"jeg"],[4,6,47.92,48.04,"er"],[7,12,48.04,48.7,"lærer~37398342c31f"],[13,15,48.92,49.24,"og"],[16,26,49.24,50.12,"underviser"],[27,29,50.12,50.4,"på"],[30,39,50.4,51.26,"norskkurs"],[41,43,51.92,52.06,"og"],[44,49,52.06,52.76,"marit"],[50,52,52.76,52.9,"er"],[53,58,52.9,53.4,"lærer~37398342c31f"],[59,61,53.4,53.58,"på"],[62,64,53.58,53.74,"en~a939a9e56dc5"],[65,75,53.74,54.66,"barneskole"],[77,79,55.68,55.88,"vi"],[80,83,55.88,56.16,"bor"],[84,90,56.16,56.55,"sammen"]]},{"id":9,"start":57.8,"end":65.66,"text":"Så hyggelig å høre. Nå må jeg skynde meg på jobb, for jeg har dårlig tid. Skal vi ta en kaffe til helga?","speaker":"Bjørnar","zh":"听到这个真好。我现在得赶去上班了，因为我时间很紧。我们周末一起喝杯咖啡好吗？","words":[[0,2,57.87,58.1,"så~f3a520a4cee7"],[3,11,58.1,58.48,"hyggelig"],[12,13,58.48,58.56,"å~0583da7a620a"],[14,18,58.56,59.02,"høre~98ec3649ebcb"],[20,22,59.8,60.12,"nå~d531d47a7712"],[23,25,60.12,60.24,"må"],[26,29,60.24,60.46,"jeg"],[30,36,60.46,60.84,"skynde"],[37,40,60.84,61.02,"meg"],[41,43,61.02,61.16,"på~a39e8fe4d6c1"],[44,48,61.16,61.62,"jobb"],[50,53,61.9,62.04,"for~a05c87659379"],[54,57,62.04,62.26,"jeg"],[58,61,62.26,62.44,"har"],[62,68,62.44,62.74,"dårlig~b05efbd61136"],[69,72,62.74,63.13,"tid"],[74,78,64.12,64.32,"skal~d1b9dc119407"],[79,81,64.32,64.44,"vi"],[82,84,64.44,64.58,"ta~ded79fb739d0"],[85,87,64.58,64.76,"en~a939a9e56dc5"],[88,93,64.76,65.06,"kaffe"],[94,97,65.06,65.16,"til~02f653494be7"],[98,103,65.16,65.5,"helga"]]},{"id":10,"start":66.09,"end":72.11,"text":"Ja, gjerne! Jeg liker å gå på kafeen i Storgata.","speaker":"Håvard","zh":"好啊，很乐意！我喜欢去 Storgata 街的那家咖啡馆。","words":[[0,2,66.16,66.62,"ja"],[4,10,67.18,67.78,"gjerne"],[12,15,68.88,69.12,"jeg"],[16,21,69.12,69.5,"liker"],[22,23,69.5,69.6,"å~0583da7a620a"],[24,26,69.6,69.84,"gå"],[27,29,69.84,70.08,"på~3ac21efb6a73"],[30,36,70.08,70.9,"kafeen"],[37,38,70.9,71.08,"i"],[39,47,71.08,71.96,"storgata"]]},{"id":11,"start":72.78,"end":77.99,"text":"Fint! Det er en hyggelig kafé. Vi snakkes til helga.","speaker":"Bjørnar","zh":"好！那是一家很舒适的咖啡馆。我们周末再聊。","words":[[0,4,72.84,73.44,"fint"],[6,9,73.94,74.32,"det"],[10,12,74.46,74.62,"er"],[13,15,74.62,74.8,"en~a939a9e56dc5"],[16,24,74.8,75.3,"hyggelig"],[25,29,75.3,75.76,"kafé"],[31,33,76.68,76.94,"vi"],[34,41,76.94,77.26,"snakkes~388b29feb9d6"],[42,45,77.26,77.42,"til~02f653494be7"],[46,51,77.42,77.84,"helga"]]},{"id":12,"start":78.59,"end":81.62,"text":"Jeg gleder meg. Ha det bra!","speaker":"Håvard","zh":"我很期待。再见！","words":[[0,3,78.65,78.96,"jeg"],[4,10,78.96,79.48,"gleder"],[11,14,79.48,79.86,"meg"],[16,18,80.92,81.1,"ha~f5b6194409e1"],[19,22,81.1,81.22,"det~58cfefde490a"],[23,26,81.22,81.47,"bra~9ed229260de6"]]},{"id":13,"start":82.11,"end":82.86,"text":"Ha det!","speaker":"Bjørnar","zh":"再见！","words":[[0,2,82.17,82.38,"ha~3ba917caad6f"],[3,6,82.38,82.71,"det~58cfefde490a"]]},{"id":14,"start":86.94,"end":88.07,"text":"Sammendrag","subheading":true,"zh":"内容摘要","words":[[0,10,87.0,87.92,"sammendrag"]]},{"id":15,"start":89.18,"end":91.94,"text":"Bjørnar møter Håvard i byen.","zh":"比约纳尔在城里遇见霍瓦尔。","words":[[0,7,89.24,90.02,"bjørnar"],[8,13,90.16,90.66,"møter~af568d886d8f"],[14,20,90.66,91.24,"håvard"],[21,22,91.24,91.34,"i"],[23,27,91.34,91.79,"byen"]]},{"id":16,"start":92.86,"end":94.27,"text":"De snakker sammen.","zh":"他们在交谈。","words":[[0,2,92.92,93.22,"de"],[3,10,93.22,93.68,"snakker"],[11,17,93.68,94.12,"sammen"]]},{"id":17,"start":95.37,"end":97.58,"text":"Bjørnar har mye å gjøre.","zh":"比约纳尔有很多事要做。","words":[[0,7,95.43,96.14,"bjørnar"],[8,11,96.14,96.44,"har"],[12,15,96.44,96.92,"mye~cc164d0dc3da"],[16,17,96.92,97.04,"å~0583da7a620a"],[18,23,97.04,97.43,"gjøre"]]},{"id":18,"start":98.49,"end":102.26,"text":"Han er skilt og har barna annenhver uke.","zh":"他离婚了，每隔一周带孩子。","words":[[0,3,98.55,98.78,"han"],[4,6,98.78,99.04,"er"],[7,12,99.04,99.76,"skilt~39bb7cd38da8"],[13,15,100.06,100.18,"og"],[16,19,100.18,100.46,"har"],[20,25,100.46,101.1,"barna"],[26,35,101.1,101.74,"annenhver"],[36,39,101.74,102.11,"uke"]]},{"id":19,"start":103.37,"end":106.21,"text":"Han pleier å levere barna før jobb.","zh":"他通常在上班前送孩子。","words":[[0,3,103.43,103.84,"han"],[4,10,103.84,104.26,"pleier"],[11,12,104.26,104.36,"å~0583da7a620a"],[13,19,104.36,104.94,"levere"],[20,25,104.94,105.42,"barna"],[26,29,105.42,105.72,"før~f9c047e06941"],[30,34,105.72,106.06,"jobb"]]},{"id":20,"start":106.96,"end":110.17,"text":"Det er travelt, men det går bra.","zh":"很忙，但还应付得来。","words":[[0,3,107.02,107.28,"det"],[4,6,107.28,107.62,"er"],[7,14,107.62,108.44,"travelt"],[16,19,108.74,109.18,"men"],[20,23,109.34,109.5,"det"],[24,27,109.5,109.74,"går~bdf67dea99b2"],[28,31,109.74,110.02,"bra~9ed229260de6"]]},{"id":21,"start":111.66,"end":114.87,"text":"Håvard er samboer med Marit.","zh":"霍瓦尔和玛丽特同居。","words":[[0,6,111.72,112.5,"håvard"],[7,9,112.94,113.18,"er"],[10,17,113.18,113.84,"samboer"],[18,21,113.84,114.04,"med~f0bfed2e74cc"],[22,27,114.04,114.72,"marit"]]},{"id":22,"start":116.01,"end":118.33,"text":"Håvard og Marit er lærere.","zh":"霍瓦尔和玛丽特都是老师。","words":[[0,6,116.07,116.56,"håvard"],[7,9,116.56,116.68,"og"],[10,15,116.68,117.32,"marit"],[16,18,117.32,117.6,"er"],[19,25,117.6,118.18,"lærere"]]},{"id":23,"start":119.72,"end":123.58,"text":"Bjørnar og Håvard skal gå på kafé i helga.","zh":"比约纳尔和霍瓦尔周末要去咖啡馆。","words":[[0,7,119.78,120.48,"bjørnar"],[8,10,120.48,120.7,"og"],[11,17,120.7,121.38,"håvard"],[18,22,121.72,121.96,"skal"],[23,25,121.96,122.14,"gå"],[26,28,122.14,122.28,"på~3ac21efb6a73"],[29,33,122.28,122.86,"kafé"],[34,35,122.86,122.98,"i~d4640500bb58"],[36,41,122.98,123.43,"helga"]]}],"lexicon":{"4.3":{"lemma":"4.3","zh":"